030" end="00:12.060">, </span><span begin="00:12.060" end="00:12.600">heaven</span><span begin="00:12.600" end="00:12.660">, </span><span begin="00:12.660" end="00:13.260">sin</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.260" end="00:15.030"><span begin="00:13.260" end="00:13.590">Saw </span><span begin="00:13.590" end="00:13.800">you </span><span begin="00:13.800" end="00:14.250">there</span><span begin="00:14.250" end="00:14.340">, </span><span begin="00:14.340" end="00:14.580">and </span><span begin="00:14.580" end="00:14.730">I </span><span begin="00:14.730" end="00:15.030">thought</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.030" end="00:17.610"><span begin="00:15.030" end="00:15.270">"</span><span begin="00:15.270" end="00:15.480">Oh </span><span begin="00:15.480" end="00:15.840">my </span><span begin="00:15.840" end="00:16.320">God</span><span begin="00:16.320" end="00:16.470">, </span><span begin="00:16.470" end="00:16.710">look </span><span begin="00:16.710" end="00:16.800">at </span><span begin="00:16.800" end="00:17.130">that </span><span begin="00:17.130" end="00:17.610">face</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.730" end="00:20.100"><span begin="00:17.730" end="00:18.060">You </span><span begin="00:18.060" end="00:18.390">look </span><span begin="00:18.390" end="00:18.840">like </span><span begin="00:18.840" end="00:19.020">my </span><span begin="00:19.020" end="00:19.320">next </span><span begin="00:19.320" end="00:20.100">mistake</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.220" end="00:25.830"><span begin="00:20.220" end="00:20.700">Love's </span><span begin="00:20.700" end="00:20.820">a </span><span begin="00:20.820" end="00:21.270">game</span><span begin="00:21.270" end="00:21.450">, </span><span begin="00:21.450" end="00:21.870">wanna </span><span begin="00:21.870" end="00:25.350">play</span><span begin="00:25.350" end="00:25.740">?</span><span begin="00:25.740" end="00:25.830">"</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.830" end="00:25.890"><span begin="00:25.830" end="00:25.890">Ayy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.890" end="00:28.350"><span begin="00:25.890" end="00:26.430">New </span><span begin="00:26.430" end="00:26.940">money</span><span begin="00:26.940" end="00:27.000">, </span><span begin="00:27.000" end="00:27.420">suit </span><span begin="00:27.420" end="00:27.690">and </span><span begin="00:27.690" end="00:28.350">tie</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.350" end="00:30.840"><span begin="00:28.350" end="00:28.560">I </span><span begin="00:28.560" end="00:28.830">can </span><span begin="00:28.830" end="00:29.190">read </span><span begin="00:29.190" end="00:29.310">you </span><span begin="00:29.310" end="00:29.580">like </span><span begin="00:29.580" end="00:29.640">a </span><span begin="00:29.640" end="00:30.840">magazine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.870" end="00:33.420"><span begin="00:30.870" end="00:31.140">Ain't </span><span begin="00:31.140" end="00:31.470">it </span><span begin="00:31.470" end="00:31.920">funny</span><span begin="00:31.920" end="00:32.130">? </span><span begin="00:32.130" end="00:32.700">Rumors </span><span begin="00:32.700" end="00:33.420">fly</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.450" end="00:35.490"><span begin="00:33.450" end="00:33.630">And </span><span begin="00:33.630" end="00:33.750">I </span><span begin="00:33.750" end="00:34.110">know </span><span begin="00:34.110" end="00:34.440">you </span><span begin="00:34.440" end="00:34.830">heard </span><span begin="00:34.830" end="00:35.220">about </span><span begin="00:35.220" end="00:35.490">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.490" end="00:37.590"><span begin="00:35.490" end="00:35.880">So </span><span begin="00:35.880" end="00:36.270">hey</span><span begin="00:36.270" end="00:36.480">, </span><span begin="00:36.480" end="00:36.810">let's </span><span begin="00:36.810" end="00:37.080">be </span><span begin="00:37.080" end="00:37.590">friends</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.650" end="00:40.110"><span begin="00:37.650" end="00:37.800">I'm </span><span begin="00:37.800" end="00:38.130">dyin' </span><span begin="00:38.130" end="00:38.250">to </span><span begin="00:38.250" end="00:38.700">see </span><span begin="00:38.700" end="00:39.030">how </span><span begin="00:39.030" end="00:39.300">this </span><span begin="00:39.300" end="00:39.690">one </span><span begin="00:39.690" end="00:40.110">ends</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.200" end="00:42.660"><span begin="00:40.200" end="00:40.590">Grab </span><span begin="00:40.590" end="00:40.710">your </span><span begin="00:40.710" end="00:41.520">passport </span><span begin="00:41.520" end="00:41.760">and </span><span begin="00:41.760" end="00:42.150">my </span><span begin="00:42.150" end="00:42.660">hand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.750" end="00:45.480"><span begin="00:42.750" end="00:42.900">I </span><span begin="00:42.900" end="00:43.110">can </span><span begin="00:43.110" end="00:43.260">make </span><span begin="00:43.260" end="00:43.350">the </span><span begin="00:43.350" end="00:43.710">bad </span><span begin="00:43.710" end="00:44.010">guys </span><span begin="00:44.010" end="00:44.340">good </span><span begin="00:44.340" end="00:44.520">for </span><span begin="00:44.520" end="00:44.610">a </span><span begin="00:44.610" end="00:45.480">weekend</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.480" end="00:47.370"><span begin="00:45.480" end="00:45.780">So </span><span begin="00:45.780" end="00:45.930">it's </span><span begin="00:45.930" end="00:46.200">gonna </span><span begin="00:46.200" end="00:46.350">be </span><span begin="00:46.350" end="00:47.370">forever</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.030" end="00:50.400"><span begin="00:48.030" end="00:48.270">Or </span><span begin="00:48.270" end="00:48.420">it's </span><span begin="00:48.420" end="00:48.660">gonna </span><span begin="00:48.660" end="00:48.930">go </span><span begin="00:48.930" end="00:49.410">down </span><span begin="00:49.410" end="00:49.590">in </span><span begin="00:49.590" end="00:50.400">flames</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.520" end="00:52.920"><span begin="00:50.520" end="00:50.730">You </span><span begin="00:50.730" end="00:50.880">can </span><span begin="00:50.880" end="00:51.060">tell </span><span begin="00:51.060" end="00:51.180">me </span><span begin="00:51.180" end="00:51.390">when </span><span begin="00:51.390" end="00:51.570">it's </span><span begin="00:51.570" end="00:52.380">over</span><span begin="00:52.380" end="00:52.470">, </span><span begin="00:52.470" end="00:52.920">mm</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.040" end="00:55.290"><span begin="00:53.040" end="00:53.250">If </span><span begin="00:53.250" end="00:53.340">the </span><span begin="00:53.340" end="00:53.700">high </span><span begin="00:53.700" end="00:54.000">was </span><span begin="00:54.000" end="00:54.360">worth </span><span begin="00:54.360" end="00:54.510">the </span><span begin="00:54.510" end="00:55.290">pain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.500" end="00:57.840"><span begin="00:55.500" end="00:55.830">Got </span><span begin="00:55.830" end="00:55.860">a </span><span begin="00:55.860" end="00:56.220">long </span><span begin="00:56.220" end="00:56.580">list </span><span begin="00:56.580" end="00:56.880">of </span><span begin="00:56.880" end="00:57.150">ex</span><span begin="00:57.150" end="00:57.180">-</span><span begin="00:57.180" end="00:57.840">lovers</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.020" end="01:00.300"><span begin="00:58.020" end="00:58.320">They'll </span><span begin="00:58.320" end="00:58.710">tell </span><span begin="00:58.710" end="00:58.980">you </span><span begin="00:58.980" end="00:59.400">I'm </span><span begin="00:59.400" end="01:00.300">insane</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.330" end="01:02.850"><span begin="01:00.330" end="01:00.780">'Cause </span><span begin="01:00.780" end="01:00.870">you </span><span begin="01:00.870" end="01:01.260">know </span><span begin="01:01.260" end="01:01.440">I </span><span begin="01:01.440" end="01:01.860">love </span><span begin="01:01.860" end="01:01.980">the </span><span begin="01:01.980" end="01:02.850">players</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.060" end="01:05.490"><span begin="01:03.060" end="01:03.360">And </span><span begin="01:03.360" end="01:03.960">you </span><span begin="01:03.960" end="01:04.680">love </span><span begin="01:04.680" end="01:04.890">the </span><span begin="01:04.890" end="01:05.490">game</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.520" end="01:07.710"><span begin="01:05.520" end="01:05.760">'Cause </span><span begin="01:05.760" end="01:05.850">we're </span><span begin="01:05.850" end="01:06.240">young </span><span begin="01:06.240" end="01:06.360">and </span><span begin="01:06.360" end="01:06.510">we're </span><span begin="01:06.510" end="01:07.710">reckless</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.010" end="01:10.500"><span begin="01:08.010" end="01:08.310">We'll </span><span begin="01:08.310" end="01:08.670">take </span><span begin="01:08.670" end="01:08.970">this </span><span begin="01:08.970" end="01:09.300">way </span><span begin="01:09.300" end="01:09.540">too </span><span begin="01:09.540" end="01:10.500">far</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.530" end="01:12.990"><span begin="01:10.530" end="01:10.890">It'll </span><span begin="01:10.890" end="01:11.250">leave </span><span begin="01:11.250" end="01:11.460">you </span><span begin="01:11.460" end="01:12.390">breathless</span><span begin="01:12.390" end="01:12.390">, </span><span begin="01:12.390" end="01:12.990">hmm</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.050" end="01:15.480"><span begin="01:13.050" end="01:13.410">Or </span><span begin="01:13.410" end="01:13.740">with </span><span begin="01:13.740" end="01:13.890">a </span><span begin="01:13.890" end="01:14.490">nasty </span><span begin="01:14.490" end="01:15.480">scar</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.510" end="01:17.850"><span begin="01:15.510" end="01:15.810">Got </span><span begin="01:15.810" end="01:15.840">a </span><span begin="01:15.840" end="01:16.200">long </span><span begin="01:16.200" end="01:16.590">list </span><span begin="01:16.590" end="01:16.890">of </span><span begin="01:16.890" end="01:17.130">ex</span><span begin="01:17.130" end="01:17.160">-</span><span begin="01:17.160" end="01:17.850">lovers</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.030" end="01:20.520"><span begin="01:18.030" end="01:18.300">They'll </span><span begin="01:18.300" end="01:18.690">tell </span><span begin="01:18.690" end="01:18.960">you </span><span begin="01:18.960" end="01:19.380">I'm </span><span begin="01:19.380" end="01:20.520">insane</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.700" end="01:23.850"><span begin="01:20.700" end="01:20.970">But </span><span begin="01:20.970" end="01:21.150">I've </span><span begin="01:21.150" end="01:21.420">got </span><span begin="01:21.420" end="01:21.480">a </span><span begin="01:21.480" end="01:21.870">blank </span><span begin="01:21.870" end="01:22.410">space</span><span begin="01:22.410" end="01:22.410">, </span><span begin="01:22.410" end="01:23.850">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.210" end="01:25.980"><span begin="01:24.210" end="01:24.420">And </span><span begin="01:24.420" end="01:24.630">I'll </span><span begin="01:24.630" end="01:24.960">write </span><span begin="01:24.960" end="01:25.080">your </span><span begin="01:25.080" end="01:25.980">name</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.750" end="01:33.360"><span begin="01:30.750" end="01:31.470">Cherry </span><span begin="01:31.470" end="01:31.950">lips</span><span begin="01:31.950" end="01:32.010">, </span><span begin="01:32.010" end="01:32.640">crystal </span><span begin="01:32.640" end="01:33.360">skies</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.390" end="01:35.700"><span begin="01:33.390" end="01:33.540">I </span><span begin="01:33.540" end="01:33.780">could </span><span begin="01:33.780" end